// A mis-shaped ask: `MakeDirectory` takes a `String`, not a record. Outside the guard this
// errors at once - `unexpected term, expected: String got: {path: ...}`, 0.085 s - and creates
// nothing. Inside the guarded entry the same line prints nothing and runs to the tool's spawn
// cap, which is why a call answers "timed out after N s" for a mistake the CLI can name.
// Run: eyg run test/fixtures/misshaped-ask.eyg              (errors in 0.09 s)
// Run: node bin/agent/refusal-probe.mjs --program test/fixtures/misshaped-ask.eyg   (silent to the cap)
// Run: node bin/agent/misshape-probe.mjs --program test/fixtures/misshaped-ask.eyg   (1 named mis-shape, no run)
perform MakeDirectory({ path: "eyg-misshaped-ask" })
